	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『機動戦士ガンダム 逆襲のシャア』に登場するヤクト・ドーガ（ギュネイ・ガス機）が、RE/100で登場！",
			"• 特徴的なデザインを、MGシリーズに比肩する造形で実現！",
			"• 劇中のイメージを踏襲しながらも、密度感を高める為に細かなディテールが追加されている！",
			"• サブスラスターのファンネルはすべて個別に取り外しができ、展開ギミックも搭載！",
			"• さらに展開状態のファンネル6基すべてをディスプレイできるクリア支柱が付属！"
		],
		"en": [
			"Yakut Doga (Gyunei Gas Machine) that appears in \"Mobile Suit Gundam: Char's Counterattack\" is now available in RE/100!",
			"• Achieving a distinctive design with a form comparable to the MG series!",
			"• While following the image from the movie, small details have been added to increase the sense of density!",
			"• All of the sub-thruster funnels can be removed individually and are equipped with an expansion gimmick!",
			"• Also included is a clear support that allows you to display all 6 funnels in the expanded state!"
		]
	},
